      "contextFingerprint": "6f04ba8a786e737491c5be804d57198770cf421ecf8bf548b1332967752f83c6",
      "sourceText": "- `std::variant<T1, T2, ...>` 是类型安全的联合体。\n- `std::get<T>(v)` 直接获取（不安全），`std::get_if<T>(&v)` 返回指针（安全）。\n- `std::visit(visitor, v)` 是最推荐的方式，强制覆盖所有类型。\n- 适用于消息分发、可选配置、状态机等场景。",
      "translatedText": "- `std::variant<T1, T2, ...>` is a type\\-safe union\\.\n- `std::get<T>(v)` Direct access (unsafe),`std::get_if<T>(&v)` return pointer (safe)\\.\n- `std::visit(visitor, v)` is the most recommended approach, enforcing coverage of all types\\.\n- Suitable for scenarios such as message dispatch, optional configuration, and state machines\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 174,
        "outputTokens": 55,
        "costUsd": 0.000119
